    "work_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-hieronymus/pl30_13_pr",
    "canonical_ref": "PL30.PR.1.s3",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Qui cum jam scripta essent Evangelia : per Matthæum quidem in Judæa : per Marcum autem in Italia :",
    "chunk_index": 3,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-hieronymus/pl30_13_pr#PL30.PR.1.s4",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-hieronymus/pl30_13_pr",
    "canonical_ref": "PL30.PR.1.s4",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "sancto instigante Spi­ ritu, in Achaiæ partibus hoc scripsit Evangelium : significans etiam ipse in principio, ante suum alia esse descripta.",
    "chunk_index": 4,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-hieronymus/pl30_13_pr#PL30.PR.1.s5",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-hieronymus/pl30_13_pr",
    "canonical_ref": "PL30.PR.1.s5",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Cui extra ea quæ ordo Evangelicae dispositionis exposcit, ea maxime necessitas laboris fuit, ut primum Græcis fidelibus omni prophetatione venturi in carnem Dei Christi manifestata humani­ tatc,",
    "chunk_index": 5,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-hieronymus/pl30_13_pr#PL30.PR.1.s6",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-hieronymus/pl30_13_pr",
    "canonical_ref": "PL30.PR.1.s6",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "De Judaicis fabulis attenti in solo legis desi­ derio tenerentur, vel ne haereticis fabulis, et stultis sollicitationibus seducti exciderent a veritate, elabo­ raret.",
    "chunk_index": 6,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-hieronymus/pl30_13_pr#PL30.PR.1.s7",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/pseudo-hieronymus/pl30_13_pr",
    "canonical_ref": "PL30.PR.1.s7",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Dehinc ut in principio Evangelii Joannis na­ tivitate praesumpta : cui Evangelium scriberet, et in quo electus scriberet, indicaret: contestans in se completa esse, quæ essent ab aliis inchoata.",
    "chunk_index": 7,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
